{
  "name": "[SUB] Image Validator - File Validation",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      },
      "id": "trigger",
      "name": "Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [240, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Gelen parametreleri al\nconst input = items[0].json;\n\n// Zorunlu: directory\nif (!input.directory) {\n  throw new Error('directory parametresi zorunlu!');\n}\n\n// API URL sabit\nconst API_URL = 'http://127.0.0.1:8100';\n\n// API Health Check config\nconst healthConfig = {\n  api_url: API_URL,\n  api_name: 'Image Validator API',\n  health_endpoint: '/health',\n  start_command: input.start_command || '',\n  max_retries: 3,\n  wait_seconds: 5\n};\n\n// Validation config\nconst validationConfig = {\n  directory: input.directory,\n  limit: input.limit || 0,\n  config: input.config || null\n};\n\nreturn [{ json: { healthConfig, validationConfig, api_url: API_URL } }];"
      },
      "id": "prepare-config",
      "name": "Prepare Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [460, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "[UTILS] API Health Check & Retry"
        },
        "workflowInputs": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "api_url": "={{ $json.healthConfig.api_url }}",
            "api_name": "={{ $json.healthConfig.api_name }}",
            "health_endpoint": "={{ $json.healthConfig.health_endpoint }}",
            "start_command": "={{ $json.healthConfig.start_command }}",
            "max_retries": "={{ $json.healthConfig.max_retries }}",
            "wait_seconds": "={{ $json.healthConfig.wait_seconds }}"
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "api-health-check",
      "name": "API Health Check",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [680, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "api-success",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.success }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "api-ok-check",
      "name": "API OK?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [900, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// API failed\nconst prepareConfig = $('Prepare Config').item.json;\nconst apiResult = items[0].json;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    valid: false,\n    reason: 'api_unavailable',\n    error: apiResult.message || 'API başlatılamadı',\n    api_name: apiResult.api_name,\n    directory: prepareConfig.validationConfig.directory\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "api-failed",
      "name": "API Failed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1120, 420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// API OK - validation config'i al\nconst prepareConfig = $('Prepare Config').item.json;\nreturn [{ json: { ...prepareConfig.validationConfig, api_url: prepareConfig.api_url } }];"
      },
      "id": "get-validation-config",
      "name": "Get Validation Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1120, 180]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $json.api_url }}/validate/directory",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ directory: $json.directory, limit: $json.limit, config: $json.config }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http-validate",
      "name": "Validate Directory",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1340, 180]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "results",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "split-results",
      "name": "Split Results",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1560, 180]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "condition-invalid",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.valid }}",
              "rightValue": false,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "filter-invalid",
      "name": "Filter Invalid",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1780, 80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "condition-valid",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.valid }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "filter-valid",
      "name": "Filter Valid",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1780, 280]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## [SUB] File Validation\n\n**API:** `http://127.0.0.1:8100`\n\n---\n\n**Giriş Parametreleri:**\n```json\n{\n  \"directory\": \"/path/to/images\",\n  \"limit\": 0,\n  \"config\": { ... },\n  \"start_command\": \"...\"\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### Zorunlu:\n- `directory`: Klasör yolu\n\n### Opsiyonel:\n- `limit`: Max dosya (0=all)\n- `config`: Override değerler\n- `start_command`: API başlatma",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 280
      },
      "id": "sticky-input",
      "name": "Sticky Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, -120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Config Override\n\n```json\n{\n  \"min_short_edge\": 1024,\n  \"max_short_edge\": 4096,\n  \"min_file_size_kb\": 50,\n  \"max_file_size_mb\": 20,\n  \"min_aspect_ratio\": 0.5,\n  \"max_aspect_ratio\": 2.0,\n  \"allowed_formats\": [\"jpg\", \"png\"]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### Red Sebepleri:\n- `api_unavailable`\n- `file_too_small`\n- `file_too_large`\n- `invalid_format`\n- `too_small` / `too_large`\n- `aspect_too_narrow/wide`\n- `corrupted`",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 260
      },
      "id": "sticky-defaults",
